## IV. متطلبات الأداء (Performance SLA)

```
Metric                    Target           Acceptable
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
API Response Time         < 500ms          < 1000ms
Image Gen/image           30-60 sec        < 120 sec
Audio Gen                 5-15 sec         < 30 sec
Video Composition         2-5 min          < 10 min
End-to-End Processing     5-10 min         < 15 min

Uptime                    99.5%            > 99%
Concurrent Users          100+             50+
Throughput                10 videos/min    5 videos/min
Error Rate                < 0.5%           < 2%
```

---

## V. متطلبات الأمان (Security)

### Authentication & Authorization
- OAuth 2.0 (Google, GitHub)
- JWT Tokens (stateless)
- Role-based Access Control (RBAC)
- MFA Support (optional)

### Data Protection
- Encryption at rest: AES-256
- TLS 1.3 for transit
- Rate limiting (per user/IP)
- DDoS protection

### API Security
- Input validation & sanitization
- SQL injection prevention
- XSS protection
- CORS configuration

---

